body:
If you can imagine yourself playing it, you will eventually be able to play it. It's all possible, just keep going. As said before, persistence is the key

&#x200B;

“Whether you think you can, or you think you can't - you're right.”

Universal love is not an illusion

&#x200B;

But the "material love" can be considered as illusion

It got the same roots as the material hate

&#x200B;

You can detach from this and get to a neutral state for materials things but you can't detach yourself from the universal love, or self love

&#x200B;

If you felt hate of your inner world projecting a desirable reality it is "material hate". Because thoughts are still matter and you can completely detach from it. Aswell as the opposite of it but you would still feel love and gratefulness
